title    Neon Metropolis (placeholder)
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Neon Metropolis's score slot: a copy of level5's until its theme round (docs/audio/SOUND-BIBLE.md).
tempo    150
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.32

# untagged voices are the base layer, the hook among them (layers only add); the intro plays every layer
voice str    strings   vol=0.32 pan=0.3 gate=0.7
voice bass   fmbass    vol=0.64 gate=0.6
voice chug   distguitar vol=0.3 pan=-0.2 gate=0.5
